model.en:
Domain owns the port: <pre><code>// domain/ports/NotificationPort.ts
interface NotificationPort {
  notifyApproval(to: string, e: ExpenseSummary): Promise<void>;
}</code></pre> The use case depends on it: <code>class ApproveExpense { constructor(private notify: NotificationPort) {} ... await this.notify.notifyApproval(mgr.email, summary) }</code>. Infrastructure adapter: <code>class SendGridNotifier implements NotificationPort { constructor(private sg: SendGrid) {} notifyApproval(to, e) { return this.sg.send(buildEmail(to, e)); } }</code>. Test adapter: <code>class InMemoryNotifier implements NotificationPort { sent = []; async notifyApproval(to, e) { this.sent.push({ to, e }); } }</code>. Wire once in <code>main.ts</code>: <code>new ApproveExpense(new SendGridNotifier(sg))</code>. The domain never imports SendGrid; swapping providers or asserting "a notice was sent" in a test is a one-line change at the edge.

model.ru:
Домен владеет портом: <pre><code>// domain/ports/NotificationPort.ts
interface NotificationPort {
  notifyApproval(to: string, e: ExpenseSummary): Promise<void>;
}</code></pre> Сценарий зависит от него: <code>class ApproveExpense { constructor(private notify: NotificationPort) {} ... await this.notify.notifyApproval(mgr.email, summary) }</code>. Адаптер инфраструктуры: <code>class SendGridNotifier implements NotificationPort { constructor(private sg: SendGrid) {} notifyApproval(to, e) { return this.sg.send(buildEmail(to, e)); } }</code>. Тестовый адаптер: <code>class InMemoryNotifier implements NotificationPort { sent = []; async notifyApproval(to, e) { this.sent.push({ to, e }); } }</code>. Подключение один раз в <code>main.ts</code>: <code>new ApproveExpense(new SendGridNotifier(sg))</code>. Домен никогда не импортирует SendGrid; смена провайдера или проверка «уведомление отправлено» в тесте — однострочное изменение на краю.

